  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pọl nʼobodo Efesọs",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe Apọlọs nọ na Kọrint, Pọl sitere ụzọ nke nʼime elu ala bịarute Efesọs. Nʼebe ahụ, ọ hụrụ ụfọdụ ndị na-eso ụzọ ahụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sị ha, \"Unu natakwara Mmụọ Nsọ mgbe unu kweere?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 19:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ha sịrị ya, \"Mba, anyị anụbeghị na ọ nwere ihe dịka Mmụọ Nsọ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ọ sịrị, \"Gịnị ka unu kwenyere nʼime ya mgbe e mere unu baptizim?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ACT 19:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ha sịrị, \"Baptizim nke Jọn.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ, Pọl sịrị, \"Baptizim Jọn bụ nke gbasara nchegharị site na mmehie, na-agwa ndị mmadụ ka ha kwere nʼonye ahụ na-eso ya na-abịa, nke bụ, ikwere nʼime Jisọs.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ha nụrụ nke a, e mere ha baptizim nʼaha Onyenwe anyị Jisọs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe Pọl bikwasịrị ha aka ya abụọ nʼisi, ha natara Mmụọ Nsọ. Ha kwukwara okwu nʼasụsụ dị iche iche, bukwaa amụma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha niile ruru ndị ikom iri na abụọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ banyere nʼụlọ nzukọ ahụ ma were nkwuwa okwu, na ịrụ ụka nʼebe o doro anya gwasie ha okwu ike banyere alaeze Chineke. Ọ bụ ọnwa atọ ka o were ya ime nke a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ụfọdụ nʼime ha mechiri obi ha; ha juru ikwenye, kama ha kwuru okwu ọjọọ megide Ụzọ ahụ nʼihu ọgbakọ ahụ niile. Ya mere, o sitere nʼebe ha nọ pụọ, kpọrọkwa ndị na-eso ụzọ ahụ, ha na-akparịta ụka kwa ụbọchị nʼụlọ ọgbakọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiranọs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a gakwara nʼihu afọ abụọ. Ndị niile bi na Eshịa nụkwara oziọma Onyenwe anyị. Ọtụtụ nʼime ha bụ ndị Juu, ma ndị ọzọ bụ ndị Griik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ụmụ Skiva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineke sitere nʼaka Pọl rụọ ọtụtụ ọrụ ebube pụrụ iche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke bụ na-ewere ụfọdụ nʼime akịsị maọbụ ịchafọ na akwa mgbochi nke metụrụ ya nʼahụ na-atụkwasị nʼahụ ndị ọrịa, ahụ a dịkwa ha ike. E sitekwara na ya chụpụ mmụọ ọjọọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ụfọdụ ndị Juu dịkwa ndị na-ejegharị nʼobodo dị iche iche na-achụpụ mmụọ ọjọọ nʼime mmadụ. Ha chọkwara ime nke a nʼaha Onyenwe anyị Jisọs na-asị, \"E ji m aha Jisọs, onye Pọl na-ekwusa na-enye unu iwu ka unu site nʼime ya pụta.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị na-eme ihe dị otu a bụ ụmụ asaa nke Skiva, onyeisi nchụaja, bụ onye Juu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmụọ ọjọọ ahụ zara ha sị, \"Amaara m onye Jisọs bụ, amakwaara m onye Pọl bụ, ma unu onwe unu, unu bụ ndị ole?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwoke ahụ mmụọ ọjọọ na-achị makwasịrị ha, tie ha ihe nke ukwuu, mee ka ha gbaa ọsọ. Ha gbara ọtọ gbapụ nʼụlọ ahụ. Ha merụkwara ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akụkọ banyere ihe ndị a jezuru obodo Efesọs niile. Mgbe ahụ, ndị Juu na ndị Griik ụfọdụ nụkwara ihe ndị a. Oke egwu jidekwara ha. Nʼihi nke a, e mekwara ka aha Onyenwe anyị Jisọs daa ụda nʼebe niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọtụtụ ndị kwenyerenụ bịara na-ekwupụta omume ọjọọ ha niile, nʼihu mmadụ niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọtụtụ nʼime ndị na-agwọ ọgwụ mgbaasị bupụtara akwụkwọ niile ha ji na-eme mgbaasị, kpọọ ha ọkụ nʼihu mmadụ niile. Akwụkwọ niile a kpọrọ ọkụ nʼụbọchị ahụ ga-eru ego ruru puku ọlaọcha iri ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, okwu Onyenwe anyị toro, na-agbasa nʼike nʼike na-adịkwa ire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ihe ndị a gasịrị, Pọl kpebiri nʼime mmụọ ya na ya ga-eje ruo Masidonia na Akaịa tupu ọ bịaruo Jerusalem. O sịkwara \"na ya aghaghị ijeru Rom nʼọgwụgwụ ije ya niile.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O zipụrụ ndị na-enyere ya aka, bụ Timoti na Erastọs ka ha buru ụzọ jeruo Masidonia. Ma ya onwe ya nọgidere nʼime Eshịa nwa oge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ọgbaaghara nʼobodo Efesọs",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọ bụ nʼoge a ka oke nsogbu malitere megide Ụzọ ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otu onye ụzụ na-agbaze ọlaọcha, aha ya bụ Dimitriọs, onye ji ọlaọcha na-akpụ ụlọ arụsị ala ahụ a na-akpọ Atemis. Ọ na-ewetara ya na ndị ụzụ ibe ya ego nʼebe o hiri nne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwoke a kpọkọtara ndị ọrụ ya niile, na ndị ya na ha na-arụkọ otu ọrụ, sị, \"Ndị ibe m, unu ma na ọ bụ site nʼọrụ nke a ka anyị si enweta akụnụba anyị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu niile ahụla ma nụkwa, otu nwoke a na-akpọ Pọl si rafuo ọtụtụ ndị mmadụ site nʼime ka ha kwenye na chi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ọbụla e ji aka mee abụghị chi. Ọ bụkwaghị naanị nʼEfesọs kama ọ fọdụrụ ihe nta ka ọ bụrụ nʼEshịa niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụkwaghị naanị na ihe ize ndụ dị banyere ọrụ aka anyị nke a ga elelị kama tinyere nke a, ụlọ nke oke chi nwanyị bụ Atemis agaghị enwekwa nsọpụrụ. Ya bụ, chi nwanyị nʼonwe ya bụ onye a na-efe nʼobodo Eshịa niile nakwa nʼelu ụwa niile ka a ga-anapụ nkwanye ugwu dịrị ya dịka chi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma mgbe ha nụrụ ihe ndị a, ha were oke iwe tie mkpu na-asị, \"Atemis ndị Efesọs dị ukwuu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọgbaaghara ahụ gbasara, zuo obodo ahụ niile. Ha banyere nʼebe a na-eme ihe ileleanya, kpọpụta Gaiọs na Arịstakọs ndị Masidonia, bụ ndị ha na Pọl na-arụkọ ọrụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pọl chọrọ ịbakwuru igwe mmadụ ahụ, ma ndị na-eso ụzọ ahụ ekweghị ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otu aka ahụ kwa, ụfọdụ ndị enyi ya nʼetiti ndị na-achị Eshịa zigakwaara ya ozi na-arịọ ya ka ọ hapụ ịbanye nʼebe ahụ a na-eme ihe ileleanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugbu a, nzukọ ahụ na-agba aghara, ụfọdụ mmadụ na-eti mkpu otu ihe, ndị ọzọ na-eti ihe ọzọ. Nʼezie, ọtụtụ nʼime ha amatakwaghị ihe ha jiri nọdụ nʼebe ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ụfọdụ ndị Juu nʼime ọgbakọ ahụ nupuru Alegzanda, sepụta ya, mee ka o buru ụzọ. Alegzanda feere ha aka ka ha dere duu mgbe ọ chọrọ ịgọrọ onwe ya nʼihu ọha mmadụ ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nʼotu ntabi anya ahụ, mgbe ha matara na ọ bụ onye Juu, ha bidoro iti mkpu ihe dịka ogologo awa abụọ na-asị, \"Atemis ndị Efesọs dị ukwuu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼikpeazụ, ode akwụkwọ nke obodo ahụ kwụsịrị igwe mmadụ ahụ ime ụzụ. O kwuru, \"Ndị ikom Efesọs, o nwere onye na-amaghị na obodo Efesọs bụ obodo na-echekwa ụlọ ofufe Atemis, na oyiyi ya nke si nʼeluigwe daa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebe ihe ndị a adịghị na ngọpụ, ọ dị mkpa ka unu nọdụ nwayọọ, ghara imebi ihe ọbụla nʼecheghị echiche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lee ugbu a, ndị a unu kpọtara nʼebe a abụghị ndị ohi, ndị na-ezuru ihe nʼogige chi anyị, maọbụ na-ekwutọ eze nwanyị arụsị anyị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na Dimitriọs na ndị ọkpụ ụzụ ibe ya nwere ihe ọbụla megide ha, ha gaa nʼụlọikpe. Ndị na-ekpe ikpe ga-eleba okwu ha anya. Kama ha mee ya nʼusoro iwu kwadoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọ bụrụ na o nwere ihe ọzọ dị iche unu chọrọ ka e mee, a ga-edozi ya na nzukọ nke ndị obodo na-eme nʼụzọ ziri ezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na egwu dị, na-eleghị anya a ga-eji ihe nke mere taa boo anyị ebubo na anyị na-ebute ọgbaaghara. Anyị enweghị ọsịsa ziri ezi banyere ọgbaaghara nke a.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe o kwuchara nke a, ọ gbasara ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
